      "value": "@{5b0c6b275853c02d9764fb82|full_name}: I've been thinking of a fps test on-upload that'd be server side would be a way better way of checking for the avatar's optimization than simple value of meshes/animators/max particles or whatever the case is. But I guess that takes a lot of the server to do so it's not possible for now? Can't know for sure.",
